      "updated": 1794894023708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The availability of huge amount of energy in the modern days has\nresulted in the shorter working days, higher agricultural and\nindustrial production, a heathier and more balanced diet and\nbetter transportation facilities. \n- Energy fuels industrial production, transportation, and services,\ncontributing to GDP growth.\n- Countries with GREATER ENERGY ACCESS tend to have HIGHER \nLEVELS OF ECONOMIC PROSPERITY.\n- There is direct correlation between ENERGY CONSUMPTION and\nPRODUCTIVITY.\n- The greater the PER-CAPITAL CONSUMPTION OF ENERGY in a country,\nthe higher the STANDARD OF LIVING of its people\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The availability of huge amount of energy in the modern days has\nresulted in the shorter working days, higher agricultural and\nindustrial production, a heathier and more balanced diet and\nbetter transportation facilities. \n- Energy fuels industrial production, transportation, and services,\ncontributing to GDP growth.\n- Countries with GREATER ENERGY ACCESS tend to have HIGHER \nLEVELS OF ECONOMIC PROSPERITY.\n- There is direct correlation between ENERGY CONSUMPTION and\nPRODUCTIVITY.\n- The greater the PER-CAPITAL CONSUMPTION OF ENERGY in a country,\nthe higher the STANDARD OF LIVING of its people\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
